The problem is that the {{ResolvingGrammarGenerator}} can't resolve a record with a nullable record unless the two have the same [full name|https://github.com/apache/avro/blob/trunk/lang/java/avro/src/main/java/org/apache/avro/io/parsing/ResolvingGrammarGenerator.java#L439]. 

